# Root-level notes are CONTENT, not template. The folder rules below never reached the repo
# root, so `Agent Memory.md` — a private Domain MOC naming a real person's unpublished paper —
# sat public for six weeks. Allowlist the schema docs; ignore every other root note by default.
/*.md
!/README.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/00 Vault Guide.md
!/Working with Claude.md

.obsidian/workspace.json
00 Bases/**.md
01 Fleeting Notes/**.md
02 Sources/**/*[.png|.jpg|.jpeg|.md]
03 Tags/**.md
04 Indexes/**.md
!04 Indexes/Wiki Index.md
!04 Indexes/Wiki Map.md
!04 Indexes/Wiki Log.md
!04 Indexes/Open Questions.md
05 Base Notes/**.md
06 Daily Notes/**.md
07 Projects/**/*[.png|.jpg|.jpeg|.md]
99 Archive/**/*[.png|.jpg|.jpeg|.md]
Clippings/**.md
Excalidraw/**.excalidraw
Images/**/*

a.out
